0 !LDRAW_ORG Unofficial_Model
0 // One fixed SPIKE Prime hub and one medium angular motor on A.
0 // Real crank, retained free pivot and two physically antiroll guided slides.
0 // Standard LDraw geometry is external and retains its original author/license.
0 // Native simulation program: 0 to360 to1080 to0 degrees; reset to saved datum before run.
